    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15730" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ēnarrātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		enarro, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a detailed exposition</i>, <i>interpretation</i>: ineffabilis sanctusque
			sermo, cujus enarratio modum hominis excedat,
				<i><span class="en">Lact. 4, 9, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 1,
				4, 2 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1,
				8, 18 al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Esp., <i>the reckoning</i> in metre, <i>scanning</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syllabarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 88, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Conversation</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg.
				Sirach, 9, 23</span></i>; <i><span class="en">38, 26</span></i>.</div>
